#. Key:	DiversionConfig:bEnableChangesWatcher
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bEnableChangesWatcher in DiversionConfig (type: BoolProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bEnableChangesWatcher in DiversionConfig (type: BoolProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,DiversionConfig:bEnableChangesWatcher"
msgid "If checked, Diversion will automatically detect and reload files that have been modified externally. e.g. by switching branches, resetting changes from the app etc. (requires editor restart)"
msgstr "If checked, Diversion will automatically detect and reload files that have been modified externally. e.g. by switching branches, resetting changes from the app etc. (requires editor restart)"

#. Key:	DiversionConfig:bEnableSoftLock
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bEnableSoftLock in DiversionConfig (type: BoolProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bEnableSoftLock in DiversionConfig (type: BoolProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,DiversionConfig:bEnableSoftLock"
msgid "If unchecked, Diversion will not warn for potential conflicts before opening and saving files that have been modified in another branch or workspace"
msgstr "If unchecked, Diversion will not warn for potential conflicts before opening and saving files that have been modified in another branch or workspace"

#. Key:	DiversionConfig:bHardLocksAvailable
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bHardLocksAvailable in DiversionConfig (type: BoolProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bHardLocksAvailable in DiversionConfig (type: BoolProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,DiversionConfig:bHardLocksAvailable"
msgid "Whether the current repository's tier supports hard locks. Not a setting: the provider\nwrites it when eligibility resolves (and clears it on close), and the EditCondition\nabove reads it to grey the prompt setting out where it can do nothing. The stored\nvalue of the setting is never touched, so a later Studio+ repo sees it as left."
msgstr "Whether the current repository's tier supports hard locks. Not a setting: the provider\nwrites it when eligibility resolves (and clears it on close), and the EditCondition\nabove reads it to grey the prompt setting out where it can do nothing. The stored\nvalue of the setting is never touched, so a later Studio+ repo sees it as left."

#. Key:	DiversionConfig:bLockByDefaultOnSave
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bLockByDefaultOnSave in DiversionConfig (type: BoolProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bLockByDefaultOnSave in DiversionConfig (type: BoolProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,DiversionConfig:bLockByDefaultOnSave"
msgid "If checked, the save dialog starts on Lock & Save for each asset. Uncheck to start on Save (without lock) instead. You can still change the choice per asset."
msgstr "If checked, the save dialog starts on Lock & Save for each asset. Uncheck to start on Save (without lock) instead. You can still change the choice per asset."

#. Key:	DiversionConfig:bPromptToLockOnSave
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bPromptToLockOnSave in DiversionConfig (type: BoolProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bPromptToLockOnSave in DiversionConfig (type: BoolProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,DiversionConfig:bPromptToLockOnSave"
msgid "Ask per asset whether to lock it when saving. Turning this off only skips the question. Lockable assets are still locked automatically on save. Requires a Studio or Enterprise repository."
msgstr "Ask per asset whether to lock it when saving. Turning this off only skips the question. Lockable assets are still locked automatically on save. Requires a Studio or Enterprise repository."

#. Key:	DiversionConfig:bShowSupportLinksInLogs
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bShowSupportLinksInLogs in DiversionConfig (type: BoolProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bShowSupportLinksInLogs in DiversionConfig (type: BoolProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,DiversionConfig:bShowSupportLinksInLogs"
msgid "If checked, Diversion error and warning messages that suggest contacting support also print the documentation and Discord links. Uncheck to keep these links out of the log."
msgstr "If checked, Diversion error and warning messages that suggest contacting support also print the documentation and Discord links. Uncheck to keep these links out of the log."

#. Key:	DiversionConfig:ResponseCacheSize
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member ResponseCacheSize in DiversionConfig (type: IntProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member ResponseCacheSize in DiversionConfig (type: IntProperty, owner: DiversionConfig)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,DiversionConfig:ResponseCacheSize"
msgid "Maximum number of HTTP responses to cache for conditional requests (ETag caching). Higher values use more memory but may reduce network requests. Minimum: 10. (requires editor restart)"
msgstr "Maximum number of HTTP responses to cache for conditional requests (ETag caching). Higher values use more memory but may reduce network requests. Minimum: 10. (requires editor restart)"

